{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-003", "question": "比较1.0与2.0的首件数量、停机条款，并说明当前旧工单用哪版。", "category": "guidance", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "1.0版首件数量为连续检查2件，停机条款为更换定位治具后必须重新进行首件确认；2.0版首件数量为连续检查3件，停机条款在更换定位治具基础上增加连续停机超过4小时后重新开工需重新首件确认。[资料1][资料2][资料3]\n当前旧工单ERP-WO-EXECUTION适用1.0版。[资料1][资料3][业务1][业务4][业务3]\n判断依据为该工单实际开工时间为2026-09-28T08:10:00+08:00，早于2026年10月1日，且无书面切换通知，故沿用1.0版。[资料1][资料3][业务4]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "1.0", "citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "a3599b26-0c0e-4856-bcc2-87e7b9c2eb3b", "document_name": "06_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书历史版.docx", "section_path": "06_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书历史版.docx", "chunk_id": "c5572d81422f8e26349afb108b6b45026b0ee9a96425f49d95b80048c71979d1", "parent_id": "af772e5749e6e742cbbdde127e6d2aa875914a66be51ca3be93bdf4372057e33", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}, {"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料2", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "c70434c8e49c9111e69919b98b789f11b979c43c5122752b2bcb10d24386cec3", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}, {"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "1.0", "citation_id": "资料3", "document_id": "a99c942a-da2e-45da-80c6-75dfad907ece", "document_name": "09_工艺变更通知ECN-2026-018.docx", "section_path": "09_工艺变更通知ECN-2026-018.docx", "chunk_id": "0e7d9855a669620f6ae2185278783182dfd756d247b4531b5f87e66d348f6823", "parent_id": "2f1d1561ab12dba731cda855a6847c2ca45e11fd084eba12d388f950c7928fbc", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}], "business_citations": [{"citation_id": "业务1", "source_system_id": "erpnext-hc