{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-091", "question": "仅按DEMO-D41合成资料，交接签名能证明质量放行吗，接班时还应关注哪些未完成项？", "category": "safety", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "仅按DEMO-D41合成资料，交接签名不能证明质量放行。[资料1]\n在DEMO-D41的检验要求中，交接签名、设备启动时间和完成数量均不能代填质量结论。[资料2][资料3]\n接班时应关注的未完成项包括：OP-50工序的首件复核结论缺失。[资料1]\n接班时应关注的未完成项还包括：OP-60工序的新映射（MAP-2）首件验证尚未完成。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "12059b15-b7d9-4d31-8e77-c54d1e139999", "document_name": "ZH-D41-10_DEMO-D41班次交接与未完成项.md", "section_path": "ZH-D41-10_DEMO-D41班次交接与未完成项.md", "chunk_id": "e8ec588c2db68468848f382ec55af77128f56c32cb1a1ef56e266cf8da47ecb0", "parent_id": "f3cc9906614ed6b1310b2c40d23452cf9b3070d930913161f655dcf202b89c55", "knowledge_base_id": "da8a470d-e735-46a6-9f0b-8628dc721840", "knowledge_base_name": "百题隔离中文扩展语料-r1"}, {"citation_id": "资料2", "document_id": "6fe41f12-cd3a-4924-83ea-2af706b8442d", "document_name": "ZH-D41-06_DEMO-D41_OP-60检验要求与记录辨析.pdf", "section_path": "DEMO-D41_OP-60检验要求与记录辨析", "chunk_id": "3d938d56705acc4e14140f0f5ca36207bc9a27cb56c988e7a9383ff9976e43ac", "parent_id": "7c5277b959beac5059f86e089f1b7aef445f658bf400399660a751cebee3593d", "knowledge_base_id": "da8a470d-e735-46a6-9f0b-8628dc721840", "knowledge_base_name": "百题隔离中文扩展语料-r1"}, {"citation_id": "资料3", "document_id": "fdef9b05-233f-4734-9f46-91a740570e7b", "document_name": "ZH-D41-05_DEMO-D41_OP-50检验要求与记录辨析.pdf", "section_path": "DEMO-D41_OP-50检验要求与记录辨析", "chunk_id": "0516f78d113e88ed8fd474a2b8a2c5bc406ce24f69976b0cc1b33f354160ef12", "parent_id": "1e7e8a74ac8043454adbc62b9e639d6ee2a27a65a84566283db4ca73aade9514", "knowledge_base_id": "da8a470d-e735-46a6-9f0b-8628dc721840", "knowledge_base_name": "百题隔离中文扩展语料-r1"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true, "snapshot_observed": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "h